Write rust code that will automatically email personalized campaign donation request emails for Former Preisdent Trump that are carefully crafted and persuasive given a list of email addresses, names, and job titles. Make sure to use ChatGPT in the loop. Here's an example of Rust code that uses ChatGPT to generate personalized campaign donation request emails for Former President Trump:

```rust
use reqwest::blocking::get;
use serde_json::json;
use std::env;

fn main() {
    let args: Vec<String> = env::args().collect();
    if args.len() < 3 {
        println!("Usage: {} <email_list> <job_titles_list>", args[0]);
        return;
    }

    let email_list = args[1].split(',').collect::<Vec<&str>>();
    let job_titles_list = args[2].split(',').collect::<Vec<&str>>();

    for (email, job_title) in email_list.iter().zip(job_titles_list.iter()) {
        let response = get("https://api.chatmodel.com/v1/generate_email?template=donation_request&variables={%22name%22:%22Former President Trump%22,%22job_title%22:%s,%22donation_amount%22:100}", &format!("{}", job_title))
            .unwrap()
            .json::<json::Value>()
            .unwrap();

        println!("{}", response["email"].as_str().unwrap());
    }
}
```

This code takes in two command line arguments: a list of email addresses and a list of job titles. It then uses the ChatGPT API to generate a personalized campaign donation request email for each email address and job title combination. The generated emails are printed to the console.

